<span id="A2.SS2.p21.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p21.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Layer:<span id="A2.SS2.p21.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> MAC  </span>Reported by:<span id="A2.SS2.p21.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> gNB  </span>Type:<span id="A2.SS2.p21.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Numerical (float)  </span>Range<span id="A2.SS2.p21.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: [0, 100] 
